        "reading": "A holder may protect or enforce its rights in its own name in proceedings against the issuer or proceedings to which both are parties, using the stated depot-bank certificate and a certified copy of the global certificate, without producing the originals. Depotbank includes an authorized bank or other recognized custody institution with which the holder maintains the relevant securities account, including the Clearing System. The final sentence also preserves any other method procedurally permitted in the country of proceedings.",
        "certificate_and_copy_route": {
          "certificate": [
            "full holder name and address",
            "aggregate nominal amount held on the certificate date",
            "confirmation that the depot bank gave the Clearing System a written statement with the name/address and nominal amount"
          ],
          "copy": "Copy of the global certificate confirmed to match the original by an authorized representative of the Clearing System or its custodian",
          "originals_required": false
        },
        "exclusive_route": false,
        "alternative_route": "Any other method procedurally permitted in the country of proceedings",
        "qualification": "Applicable procedural law and actual standing/proof are not adjudicated. Do not convert this litigation qualification into blanket permission to disregard the holder-notice form and delivery requirements."
